# Markdown Entry Timestamps

When adding new dated planning, decision, story, QA, or handoff entries to Markdown files, include the local date and time.

Use this format unless the file already has a stronger local convention:

```markdown
- [2026-06-27 09:33 UTC+1] Entry text.
```

Do not rewrite old historical entries solely to add timestamps unless the user asks for a backfill.
